What is a Stream? { #what-is-a-stream }

"Streaming" data means that your app will start sending data items to the client without waiting for the entire sequence of items to be ready.

So, it will send the first item, the client will receive and start processing it, and you might still be producing the n

 list), but instead of being wrapped in [] and having , between the items, it has one JSON object per line, they are separated by a new line character.

